  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Initiating Project Setup**\n\nI\'ve successfully installed key packages: `jspdf`, `jspdf-autotable`, `xlsx`, `chart.js`, and `react-chartjs-2`. My focus now shifts to designing a modular, polished, and functional React app for PERFORT ALMOX - Controle de Estoque. I\'m starting to organize the codebase structure for optimal development.\n\n\n**Defining Core Components**\n\nI\'ve defined key data types and interfaces in `/src/types.ts` including crucial models. Mock data has been prepped in `/src/data/mockData.ts`, containing initial values for Obras, Items, Fam\303\255lias, and Users. I\'m focusing on tenant-based `localStorage` helpers, audit logging, export functionality, and potential integration with AI tools.\n\n\n**Planning Component Architecture**\n\nI\'m now deep in defining components for data entry and reporting within the app, specifically for stock entries, exits, and inventory management, and reports with PDF and Excel export. Also, I have established new components to be added for Alerts and Concretagem Quality control. These will feature robust search, filtering, and export capabilities. User and Obras management are also in the works.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 8
      nanos: 192077039
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
